# save: 05-Twoson
# boot: menu
# File select with slot 1 used: empty slot 2 (text speed menu, B back to slot 1), slot 1's
# submenu (Copy -> B, Set Up -> B), then Continue into the game
# The port runs FILE_SELECT_INIT's battle-BG entity (EVENT_787, slot 23) as a stand-in
# call (file_menu_bg_update), so slot 23 is empty there
# ignore: ent23\..*
# The original loads the map across lag frames after Continue: frame 870 is sampled
# part-way through it (still in FILE_SELECT_INIT)
# skip: 870
# idle=fade is the INIDISP brightness, which the original's fades step on NMIs: after its load lag
# the fade-in ends a frame later in logic frames (wall-clock noise; positions and RNG still match)
# ignore: idle
---
press DOWN; wait 30; press A; wait 60; press B; wait 120
press A; wait 90; press RIGHT; wait 30; press A; wait 90; press B; wait 120
press RIGHT 3; wait 30; press A; wait 90; press B; wait 120
press A; wait 600
